Name: opentrim
Version: 1.2.0
Date: 2026-09-01
Author: OpenTRIM contributors
Maintainer: George Apostolopoulos <gapost@ipta.demokritos.gr>
Title: GNU Octave bindings for OpenTRIM
Description: Provides opentrim.config, opentrim.driver, and opentrim.info
 objects for setting up, running, and reading results from OpenTRIM
 ion-in-matter Monte Carlo simulations.  Requires a compatible version of
 libopentrim to be installed on the system.
Depends: octave (>= 6.0)
License: MIT
Url: https://github.com/gapost/opentrim
